  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">점점&nbsp;희망이&nbsp;보입니다.&nbsp;수업이&nbsp;변하고&nbsp;있어요.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">거꾸로&nbsp;시작한&nbsp;지는&nbsp;몇&nbsp;달&nbsp;됐는데&nbsp;벽에&nbsp;막힌&nbsp;들&nbsp;답답했어요.&nbsp;활동(실험&nbsp;등)을&nbsp;열심히&nbsp;준비했지만&nbsp;학생들은&nbsp;수업내용에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;얘기보다&nbsp;장난치고&nbsp;딴&nbsp;얘기를&nbsp;하는&nbsp;시간이&nbsp;길기도&nbsp;했구요.&nbsp;굳이&nbsp;없어도&nbsp;되는&nbsp;실험이었나&nbsp;싶기도&nbsp;한&nbsp;걸&nbsp;하기도&nbsp;했구요&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">흥미유발에&nbsp;맞춰졌던&nbsp;초점을&nbsp;아이들끼리&nbsp;무조건&nbsp;같이&nbsp;하게&nbsp;만들기로&nbsp;옮겼습니다.&nbsp;좋은&nbsp;자료와&nbsp;실험을&nbsp;버리고&nbsp;동영상&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;복습하는&nbsp;수준의&nbsp;학습지만&nbsp;제시했어요.&nbsp;시간&nbsp;제한을&nbsp;주고&nbsp;그&nbsp;안에&nbsp;모든&nbsp;조원이&nbsp;그걸&nbsp;완성한&nbsp;조에게만&nbsp;도장을&nbsp;찍어주겠다!&nbsp;로요.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">한&nbsp;시간씩&nbsp;지날수록&nbsp;더&nbsp;많이&nbsp;수업내용에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;얘기를&nbsp;하고,&nbsp;모두&nbsp;책을&nbsp;열고&nbsp;찾고&nbsp;있네요.&nbsp;수업에&nbsp;흥미가&nbsp;없던&nbsp;애들이&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;제대로&nbsp;적습니다.&nbsp;단순히&nbsp;베끼기에서&nbsp;벗어나기&nbsp;시작하는&nbsp;모습도&nbsp;여럿&nbsp;봤습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">희망이&nbsp;보이네요.&nbsp;제가&nbsp;가진&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">걸&nbsp;놓고.&nbsp;기본만&nbsp;해주고&nbsp;애들을&nbsp;믿었더니&nbsp;ㅎㅎ</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">(즐겁고&nbsp;기쁜데&nbsp;목은&nbsp;엄청&nbsp;아프고,&nbsp;해독불가수준&nbsp;글씨들&nbsp;계속&nbsp;보고&nbsp;있으니&nbsp;눈이&nbsp;아프고,과학실을&nbsp;몇&nbsp;바퀴&nbsp;돌아다니니&nbsp;퇴근할&nbsp;때는&nbsp;에너지고갈상태가&nbsp;되요.^^&nbsp;)</span></p><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">------------------</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">아이들 모습을 잠시 첨부합니다.</span></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"line-height: 18px;\">좋은 동영상과 잘 짜인 설명에도 전혀 관심없던 각반 1~3명의 장난만 치는 학생도 열심히 수업활동을 합니다.&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"line-height: 18px;\">아이들이 시간이 빨리 지나갔다고 하고, 예전수업보다 재밌다고 하네요.&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"line-height: 18px;\">제가 자~알 설명하는 것보다 자기들끼리 대충 알아듣게 하는 게 더 좋은가봅니다.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></div><div><iframe id=\"vf876R70id7RdTCBd0RixBi\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vf876R70id7RdTCBd0RixBi?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZmODc2UjcwaWQ3UmRUQ0JkMFJpeEJpIiwidGlkIjoiZmYzZDdmMTItMTkxYS00Yjk2LWFjMWQtYTRmYzVlZDVjM2Q2IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTkyMjY1fQ.KWDDfUroIqUHSDMPinabrPkPVgeDwL6Rzb-26CA41xX6DmCU527_4wW_BfXtgkfcQjCT5xXGLCdJL_s_tgsWMQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div class=\"autosourcing-stub-extra\" style=\"position: absolute; opacity: 0; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움;\"></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
